<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (YOGDAAN is the Annual Donation Drive of GYWS which is organised every year. This time, our theme was Hostel Sustenance and Expansion. The contribution of IIT Kharagpur Students was crucial in making a big difference in the lives of those less fortunate. The donation drive began on January 12th and continued until January 23rd. Our team members visited each hall room to room on the given dates to collect donations. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
60 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Their support marked a significant contribution towards providing adequate funds for hostel construction and maintenance. We managed to raise a hefty amount of INR 5.7 Lakhs, making it the record highest amount collected in Yogdaan collection over the years. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
