139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 53 0 R
/T (The workshop was conducted on 18th January 2025. The Vedic Maths Workshop aimed to provide students from Grade 1 to Grade 5 with Vedic maths tricks to enhance their calculation skills by providing alternative methods to make their calculations faster. The workshop also aimed to make learning math enjoyable and boost students' confidence in solving arithmetic problems efficiently. The workshop was conducted for classes 1 to 3 and 4 to 5 separately. )
/E (The workshop was conducted on 18th January 2025. The Vedic Maths Workshop aimed to provide students from Grade 1 to Grade 5 with Vedic maths tricks to enhance their calculation skills by providing alternative methods to make their calculations faster. The workshop also aimed to make learning math enjoyable and boost students' confidence in solving arithmetic problems efficiently. The workshop was conducted for classes 1 to 3 and 4 to 5 separately. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 53 0 R
/T (The event began with fun attention games to make them feel comfortable. Following this, the participants were briefed about Vedic maths and its importance. Then, the RISE Team members taught them some Vedic maths tricks and covered examples with each trick. Also, for every trick covered, one student was asked to volunteer and solve the question on the blackboard. Rewards were also given after solving it correctly to motivate them to participate. The participants enthusiastically solved the problems.)
/E (The event began with fun attention games to make them feel comfortable. Following this, the participants were briefed about Vedic maths and its importance. Then, the RISE Team members taught them some Vedic maths tricks and covered examples with each trick. Also, for every trick covered, one student was asked to volunteer and solve the question on the blackboard. Rewards were also given after solving it correctly to motivate them to participate. The participants enthusiastically solved the problems.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
