/Title (The event began with fun attention games to make them feel comfortable. Following this, the participants were briefed about Vedic maths and its importance. Then, the RISE Team members taught them some Vedic maths tricks and covered examples with each trick. Also, for every trick covered, one student was asked to volunteer and solve the question on the blackboard. Rewards were also given after solving it correctly to motivate them to participate. The participants enthusiastically solved the problems.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 526 0 R
/Prev 560 0 R
/Next 586 0 R
>>
endobj
582 0 obj
<<
/Title (Following this, students were encouraged to step forward and conduct some experiments themselves, fostering interactive learning. The scientific principles behind each experiment were then explained in a fun and engaging manner. The students participated enthusiastically in the event and also developed interest towards science.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 526 0 R
/Prev 586 0 R
/Next 561 0 R
>>
endobj
