/Title (This event was conducted on 26th March, 2025.The event aims to ignite curiosity and foster a deeper understanding of scientific principles through interactive experiments. By encouraging hands-on participation and engaging explanations, students will develop a greater appreciation for science in a fun and educational environment. The event also seeks to promote teamwork, critical thinking, and active learning, with special recognition for enthusiastic participation. It was conducted for the hostel students on Sunday. It began with an exciting demonstration of experiments to capture their curiosity.)
